  "abilities": [],
  "behavior": "It stays in a fairly remote area and, once found, keeps the regular Green Shield Bug pattern: bites, charges, jumps, and gas clouds used to control space.",
  "interactionWithPlayer": "It is very durable, but much of the difficulty comes from reaching it. The route can consume healing items, food, durability, and other resources before the fight even begins.",
  "interactionWithCreatures": "Its combat area is relatively quiet and is not usually surrounded by many threats. If you remain near its spawn area, other creatures are unlikely to interfere much during the fight.",
  "strategy": "Arrive with enough resources and avoid wasting them unnecessarily on the way. Bring gas protection, preferably use Stabbing damage, and always check its infusion: Fresh → Sour, Sour → Spicy, and Spicy → Fresh. Once in its area, try to keep the fight there so you do not attract outside threats.",
